---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const groups = [
  ['Your voice', [
    'With your Gnani key saved, a command\'s recording goes to Gnani only while you hold the talk key. The key is encrypted on your PC.',
    'Without a key, or offline, a small model on your PC hears it instead. Text on screen is read with Windows\' own OCR.',
  ]],
  ['Dictation', [
    'The recording goes to Gnani only while you hold the dictation key, and it is never saved.',
    'The words are pasted through a private copy that skips clipboard history, your clipboard is put back, and the log only counts words.',
    'It is off in password boxes, and shows only "Dictating…" while you share your screen.',
  ]],
  ['What leaves your PC, and when', [
    'Searches go to Google only when you ask. The island says "Sent to Google" whenever an image goes to Lens.',
    'A circled phone number, email, link, date, address, sum, colour, time zone, flight, tracking number, PNR, UPI ID or vehicle number is read on your PC and goes nowhere.',
    'A circled name or term of one to four words is looked up on Wikipedia, with only those words.',
    'A question, an "explain" or a translation goes to Google (AI Mode or Translate) only when you ask, with only those words.',
    'For an IFSC or PIN code, only the code goes to a free public lookup (Razorpay\'s IFSC service, India Post).',
    '"Weather in a city" sends only that city name to Open-Meteo, with no account and no key.',
    'Your calendar is read only from Google, at the secret address you pasted.',
  ]],
  ['Sharing your screen', [
    'While you share or record your whole screen, message text, meeting titles, reminders, notes and clipboard text are hidden.',
    'Stage and its ring light never show up in a share or a recording.',
    'One-time codes are copied privately, cleared after a minute, hidden while you share, and never written to the log.',
  ]],
  ['Your data on your PC', [
    'Clipboard history, notes, snippets and your calendar\'s address are encrypted with Windows DPAPI under your account.',
    'Unpinned clipboard items are forgotten after 24 hours. Logs never hold what you said, searched, dictated or copied, and are kept for 3 days.',
    'Phone transfers stay on your own network behind a random one-time link. Claude Code talks to Shammy only on your PC, through a local address with a random token.',
  ]],
  ['This website', [
    'No cookies and no trackers. If page counts are switched on later, they will use GoatCounter, which counts visits without cookies or personal data.',
  ]],
] as const;
---
<Base title="Privacy · Shammy" description="What Shammy keeps on your PC, what leaves it, and when.">
  <section class="page wrap">
    <h1>What stays on your PC.</h1>
    <div class="head">
      <p class="lead">Shammy does most things on your own computer. When something has to go online, it goes only when you ask, with only what it needs.</p>
      <div class="says" data-ui aria-label="What the island says: Dictating… while you share your screen, and Sent to Google when an image goes to Lens">
        <span class="isle-pill"><span class="isle-eyes" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span>Dictating…</span>
        <span class="isle-pill"><span class="isle-eyes" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span><span class="g" aria-hidden="true"></span>Sent to Google</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="groups">
      {groups.map(([title, items]) => (
        <section class="group" aria-labelledby={title}>
          <h2 id={title}>{title}</h2>
          <ul>{items.map((i) => <li>{i}</li>)}</ul>
        </section>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { padding-top: clamp(64px, 10vw, 140px); padding-bottom: 120px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(44px, 6.4vw, 96px); }
  .lead { margin-top: 24px; }
  .head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr; gap: 32px 64px; align-items: end; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .says { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 14px; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .says { align-items: flex-start; } .says .isle-pill:last-child { transform: translateX(24px); } }
  .says .isle-pill:last-child { transform: translateX(-28px); }
  .g { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mint); }
  .groups { margin-top: 72px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 56px 64px; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .groups { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 34px); letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  ul { margin: 18px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  li::marker { color: var(--mint); }
</style>
